  "statuteText": "261:145 Exemption for Publicly Owned Vehicles. –\n\nVehicles owned or operated by the state, or by any county, city, town, or school district, or by any volunteer fire department, or by any public or private educational institution used for the purpose of student driver training, shall be exempt from registration fees but shall be registered as any other vehicles are."
